<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Whoso is thirsty come hither,</l><l>Here is abundant supply;</l><l>Water transparent as crystal,</l><l>Come without money and buy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Cleanse me, oh, cleanse me, my Savior,</l><l>Make me a channel today;</l><l>Empty me, fill me and use me,</l><l>Teach me to trust and obey.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Then, and then only, Lord Jesus,</l><l>Through me the rivers can flow;</l><l>Thus and thus only will others</l><l>Learn Thy great fulness to know.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Now I surrender to Jesus,</l><l>Here I lay all at His feet;</l><l>Anything, anywhere only,</l><l>Just for His service made meet!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
